@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiểm tra máy chủ → 200
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sách bài tập → 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Nộp bài hợp lệ → 201 + Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assignmentId": 1, "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/sv001/EduSubmit" }

### 4. Nộp bài thiếu studentCode → 400
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assignmentId": 1, "studentCode": "", "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/sv001/EduSubmit" }

### 5. Nộp bài assignmentId = 0 → 400
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assignmentId": 0, "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/sv001/EduSubmit" }

### 6. (Mở rộng) Đọc lại lượt nộp vừa tạo → 200
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 7. (Mở rộng) Lượt nộp không tồn tại → 404
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
